{"numberOfHits":1,"results":[{"id":"GO:0051641","isObsolete":false,"name":"cellular localization","definition":{"text":"A cellular localization process whereby a substance or cellular entity, such as a protein complex or organelle, is transported to, and/or maintained in, a specific location within a cell including the localization of substances or cellular entities to the cell membrane."},"comment":"Note that this term is in the subset of terms that should not be used for direct gene product annotation. Instead, select a child term or, if no appropriate child term exists, please request a new term. Direct annotations to this term may be amended during annotation QC.","synonyms":[{"name":"cellular localisation","type":"exact"},{"name":"establishment and maintenance of cellular localization","type":"exact"},{"name":"establishment and maintenance of localization in cell or cell membrane","type":"exact"},{"name":"intracellular localization","type":"narrow"},{"name":"localization within cell","type":"narrow"},{"name":"single organism cellular localization","type":"exact"},{"name":"single-organism cellular localization","type":"related"}],"subsets":["goslim_pir"],"children":[{"id":"GO:0070631","relation":"is_a"},{"id":"GO:0060341","relation":"regulates"},{"id":"GO:0046907","relation":"is_a"},{"id":"GO:0051651","relation":"part_of"},{"id":"GO:0051668","relation":"is_a"},{"id":"GO:0120290","relation":"is_a"},{"id":"GO:0071166","relation":"is_a"},{"id":"GO:0051666","relation":"is_a"},{"id":"GO:0051649","relation":"part_of"}],"secondaryIds":["GO:1902580"],"history":[{"timestamp":"2024-04-17","action":"Added","category":"SUBSET","text":"gocheck_do_not_annotate"},{"timestamp":"2020-03-15","action":"Added","category":"RELATION","text":"is a GO:0009987 (cellular process)"},{"timestamp":"2017-08-13","action":"Added","category":"SECONDARY","text":"GO:1902580 (single-organism cellular localization)"},{"timestamp":"2017-08-13","action":"Added","category":"SYNONYM","text":"single-org